@Gilpin
The UFC always saves heavyweight title fights for late fall/winter so that's kind of give in that I factored in already. Not only is Ilia probably never fighting Arman but he is almost certainly not fighting again in 2026 after the White House card. The only person hed turn around and fight that quickly is Islam and thats not happening in 2026.

Im going to this card so trust me, I hope Islam is on it. Im just saying I won't be surprised if it doesnt end up happening. I think Merab/Yan is a rare good trilogy fight that would still be a great main event.
